<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66470" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσο-νύκτιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>at
			midnight</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκλειψις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					367b26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					19.31
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Anacreont.</u>
				31.1
			</span></i>: with a Verb, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσονύκτιον δέξασθαί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
				</span></i>
			<i>l.</i><i><span class="en">
				7(6).5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ὠλλύμαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					914
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): neut. as Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				13.69
			</span></i>: as Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσο-νύκτιον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jd.</u>
				16.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				339.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὸ μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.5.42
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				16.25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσονυκτίου</span>”
				<i>at midnight,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ev.Marc.
					13.35
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσονύκτου</span> seems to be
				f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Sotion
				p.185
			</span></i> W.—Poet. word acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				36
			</span></i>:—the spelling <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσᾰνύκτιον</span></b>  is v.l. in
			<u>Ev.Marc.</u> l. c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1768.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>.</div>
